From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:24:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): archive hides the sidebar row instantly
 [daveey]
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Archive used to wait for the linked-work preflight (session ancestry +
kanban task reads, plugin archive guards; up to ~14 s on a busy or remote
backend), then the offline check, before the row left the sidebar. Now
the row is soft-hidden (and the open chat deselected) the moment archive
is invoked; a cancelled linked-work dialog, unresolved owner, failed
offline queue or failed archive RPC restores it. The confirmation itself
is unchanged.

Tests: archive-linked-confirm.test.tsx — row gone before a pending guard
and RPC settle; gone while the dialog is open, back on Cancel; offline
row hidden at once and restored when the hub queue fails (RED on main);
RPC failure restores (control).
